    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span><span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/merge-sorted-array/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 88</a></div>\n  <h1>Merge Sorted Array</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: the free space is at the back, so merge from the back: always write the larger of the two last values into the last empty slot, and stop when the second array runs out. O(m + n) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
